               libomx-contract-dev (>= 3.17.2~),
               libomx-contract-dev (<< 4~),
               libomxdsp-dev (>= 0.32.0~),
               libomxdsp-dev (<< 0.33~),
               pkgconf,
               python3
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/FreeMixer/plugin-hostd-protocol
